cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite these criteria, please cite the versioned path (criteria/vX.Y/), not criteria/latest. Published versions are frozen; latest moves."
title: "Evaluator Integrity Criteria"
abstract: >-
  Criteria for auditing the evaluators AI teams use to measure their own
  systems — LLM judges and test harnesses. Each criterion is drawn from a
  published result rather than invented, and every quantity the criteria state
  is recorded against the source it was read from. Published with a corpus of
  27 scored framework-default configurations so that any score can be
  re-derived from the artifacts it cites.
type: dataset
